{"title": "Diamond Scales (Condition)", "pageid": 30211, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/30px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/45px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/60px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bulette Diamond Scales Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/30px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Diamond Scales</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This creature has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"100 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 100 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li>\n<li>While it has these temporary hit points:\n<ul><li>It is grounded.</li>\n<li>Any damage lower than 15 will not affect it.</li>\n<li>It can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/38px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/50px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shredding Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\">Shredding Scales</a> immediately after being hit for the first time in a round. </li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DIAMONDSCALES_BULETTE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDIAMONDSCALES_BULETTE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDIAMONDSCALES_BULETTE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>In Honour mode, the <a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">Bulette</a> starts with <b>Diamond Scales</b>.</li>\n<li>Grounded prevents the Bulette from being moved by force.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Diamond_Scales\">Sources of Diamond Scales</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/30px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/45px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/60px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shredding Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/30px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\">Shredding Scales</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Diamond_Scales\">Creatures with Diamond Scales</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/30px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/45px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/60px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bulette\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/30px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">Bulette</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203839\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1758/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23